    <h2>关于南北校区医院最新上班时间的通知</h2>
			<h3><span>作者：</span><span>时间：2024-09-27</span><span>点击数：<script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1827564999, 2486)</script></span></h3>
<div class="con_con"><p>
    <div id="vsb_content"><div class="v_news_content">
<p style="line-height: 2em; text-indent: 0em; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;">各位师生：</span></p><p style="text-indent: 2em; font-size: 21px; line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;">现将南北校区医院各科室最新工作时间予以公布，请大家相互转告，合理安排时间就诊。</span></p><p style="text-indent: 2em; font-size: 21px; line-height: 2em; text-align: center;"><span style="font-family:仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312">北校区医院</span></p><p style="text-indent: 2em; font-size: 21px; line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family:仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312"></span></p><p style="text-align: center"><img src="/__local/C/A1/46/E87C13A0D851D01F4D8178CF2A9_1D2A91C7_1324E.jpg" width="400" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/CA146E87C13A0D851D01F4D8178CF2A9/1D2A91C7/1324E" vheight="" vwidth="400" orisrc="/__local/8/A9/C0/3877FCC1D8339206A6B7251CFFE_696A5B68_407A9.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p><p style="text-align: center"><img src="/__local/8/4D/CD/B78757D36D0E5E1217386B76948_1E990ABE_C9B6.jpg" width="400" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/84DCDB78757D36D0E5E1217386B76948/1E990ABE/C9B6" vheight="" vwidth="400" orisrc="/__local/E/8D/DF/E55AA7DE648EC7AEC3184B11A59_61D06B28_DB2F.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p><p style="text-indent: 2em; font-size: 21px; line-height: 2em; text-align: center;"><span style="font-family:仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312">南校区医院</span></p><p style="text-indent: 2em; font-size: 21px; line-height: 2em;"><span style="font-family:仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312"></span></p><p style="text-align: center"><img src="/__local/5/87/4F/B684A5811C2134116B74642B968_C0B83C81_BBAD.jpg" width="400" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/5874FB684A5811C2134116B74642B968/C0B83C81/BBAD" vheight="" vwidth="400" orisrc="/__local/F/10/F4/D84EA5BABF4999ED96CC9965912_F3511B1D_B5C0.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p><p style="text-align: center;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;">南校区医院辅楼——医技楼</span></p><p style="text-align: center"><img src="/__local/D/21/4F/BAB9FBCC8F7D7096AAE2C1E786A_809CE901_2FF4.jpg" width="400" vsbhref="vurl" vurl="/_vsl/D214FBAB9FBCC8F7D7096AAE2C1E786A/809CE901/2FF4" vheight="" vwidth="400" orisrc="/__local/2/AC/15/921818037CE906ECB95221F518F_2C4D893A_6789.jpg" class="img_vsb_content"></p><p style="text-indent: 2em; line-height: 2em; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; text-indent: 2em; font-size: 21px;">特别说明：</span><span style="font-family:仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312"><br></span></p><p style="text-indent: 2em; line-height: 2em; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;">1.24小时值班科室工作安排为周一至周日，外科急诊为周六、周日，其余为周一至周五；</span></p><p style="text-indent: 2em; line-height: 2em; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;">2.南校区医院部分科室暂未安装电话，如有问题可拨打急诊科029-81891203咨询；</span></p><p style="text-indent: 2em; line-height: 2em; font-size: 21px;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312; font-size: 21px;">3.总机029-88202758现出现故障暂时无法转接，恢复后另行通知，给大家带来了不便非常抱歉。</span></p><p><br></p><p style="text-align: right;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312;">校医院</span></p><p style="text-align: right;"><span style="font-size: 21px; font-family: 仿宋_gb2312, fangsong_gb2312;">2024年9月</span></p><p><br></p>
</div></div><div id="div_vote_id"></div></p>
